WEBVTT

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:16.900
You're late.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:33.450
It's finally time for the
second day of the Justice 5!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:39.580
These next two matches will decide
the fate for all of Beyblading!

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.660
Garland's in the
fourth match.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:46.600
So I won't even
need to play.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:52.560
Good for you! Garland's win
means a break for you!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.680
I have no intention
of losing, after all.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.450
Good luck. I'm gonna
go take a nap.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:04.970
BEGA took the overwhelming advantage
on day one with two wins and one draw!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:12.650
But the G-Revolutions are on standby, waiting to put their foot down on the second day!

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:18.400
Yet the G-Revolutions are
standing on the edge of a cliff!

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:23.720
A loss, or even a draw in these remaining
two matches will spell the end for them!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.500
Can they turn
this around?!

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:31.050
They're all counting us out.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.660
They're gonna be sorry.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.680
Getting serious with their backs
against the wall? Not a bad look.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.160
We have to win
these last two matches.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.730
No mercy!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:58.940
The G-Revolutions are
pushed to the edge!

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.480
How will they fight these
last two matches?!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:06.160
While it's certain that Takao
Kinomiya will step up to the plate...

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:10.130
Who will be
their last player?!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:15.760
Let's get these last
two matches over with!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:20.400
I won't be playing in
the fourth match!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.040
It's him!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.280
What a surprise!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:33.650
Appearing from the G-Revolutions' corner! It's Kai Hiwatari, who's been missing since the qualifiers!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:36.740
It's Kai Hiwatari!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:46.640
What?! He's on
the G-Revolutions?!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:51.690
Kai Hiwatari's gonna play
in the fourth match!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:05:03.200
The man himself, Kai Hiwatari, has come out to fight the fourth match for the G-Revolutions!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.860
I bet you're scared!

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.980
With Kai on our side
we've got nothing to fear!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.500
Whoopsie!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.700
Maybe you forgot he couldn't
even win the BEGA qualifiers?

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:19.220
I see you climbed
your way out of hell.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:23.300
There goes your nap, Brooklyn.

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:26.970
Get lost, loser!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.090
Traitor!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.250
Get out here, Brooklyn!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:42.940
Kai challenges Brooklyn,
the one who beat him in the qualifiers!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.490
Is this his revenge match?!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.100
Me? Why?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.480
Orders are orders, Brooklyn.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.320
Brooklyn's popular!

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:59.360
What a pain.
You go, Garland.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.300
He would never accept that.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.680
Go, Brooklyn. Coach's orders.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.400
You're going to play
in the fourth match.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.260
Go.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.260
Yeah!

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:24.240
Show that loser who's boss!

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.100
Kai!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:30.090
I'm sure you're aware,
but we can't even tie.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.200
You better win!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.640
It's all up to you, Kai!

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.480
You can do it!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.440
We're counting on you, Kai!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.580
Everything's riding on you, Kai!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:50.280
I will defeat Brooklyn.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.620
As such...

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:06.400
No matter what happens in
this match, I haven't changed.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.810
Kai...

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.770
He changed teams.

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:20.980
By sending out someone who already lost,
they must be relying on that Heavy Metal System.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:25.170
That won't be enough to
defeat Brooklyn's natural talent.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.260
Was sending Brooklyn
a wise decision?

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:42.250
Do you think
he'll lose? Or...

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:46.410
Do you think you can beat
someone Brooklyn can't?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.010
That would result in a
draw for the whole thing.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.260
Which means I can't
allow myself to lose.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:06.490
The fourth match of the Justice 5 will be between Brooklyn of BEGA and Kai of the G-Revolutions!

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:10.860
Who will the goddess
of victory smile upon?!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.380
Here we go again.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.960
I don't think the
result will change.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:21.000
Let's find out if
it'll change or not!

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:25.700
You got a new top.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:29.450
But these tops are all
the same anyway.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.330
Oh dear...

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:35.010
I can see it.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:40.450
Fourth match!
Brooklyn VS Kai Hiwatari!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:45.750
Will this match end in Kai's
revenge or his shocking defeat?!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.890
Three! Two! One!

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.180
Go, Shoot!

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.560
Go, Dranzer!!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.120
Not yet!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.300
It's all the same.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:23.140
Nothing has changed.
I already know.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.700
Go, Dranzer!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.810
Goodness...
You just don't get it.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.180
What's wrong with Kai?

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:47.570
This is going to end up as a
redo of their last match!

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:52.240
Is beating Brooklyn beyond
the Heavy Metal System?

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.600
Kai...!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.820
No! I believe in Kai.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.490
Kai won't let
it end like this!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.450
What do you...

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.010
Not yet.
I need more.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.090
More! More!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.370
You intend to continue?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:16.680
Nothing will change.
You're so stubborn.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.590
Oh, I know.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.760
What?

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:26.000
You look down on us from
above, like ants to a bird!

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.740
If I want to start
climbing to reach you...

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.730
I need much more, Brooklyn.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.500
I see. You want me to
attack a little more.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:52.490
How about this?
Give up yet?

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:16.300
That's it. Keep going.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.170
More.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:23.800
Keep stirring my
hatred and rage!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:38.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:44.400
More! Keep stirring
my hatred and rage!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.730
Kai...!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.640
That's--

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.240
Do you see that?

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.760
What is that?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.290
What the hell is going on?

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:03.250
What's that? It's weird.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.490
What is it, sis?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:09.740
Yikes...
He totally missed the point!

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.900
Romero, what is that?

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:18.320
The Heavy Metal Beys respond to the
Blader's emotions more than ever before.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.860
Emotions?

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.440
Right! It's just like...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:27.240
What sort of emotion you put into the Bey
depends on the Blader's personality.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:31.640
And now Kai's trying to
fight with rage and hatred.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.810
No...!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.200
I even told him to stop.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.850
Kai's acting weird!
This isn't like him!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.410
What's Kai trying to pull?!

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:59.820
Is he gonna be alright?
This isn't normal!

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:00.840
Kai!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.580
I can feel those bad vibes
from all the way over here!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:08.620
Takao, we need to
stop Kai! Or else...!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.280
No...

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.100
I won't stop him!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.120
He told me to leave
this match to him!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.490
No matter what!

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:20.100
But if he keeps this up...

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:23.640
No! I can't stop him!

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:28.000
I believe in him!
I trust him to handle this!

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.540
More! More!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:37.560
Keep stirring my
hatred and rage!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.290
Go!!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.850
Now things are
getting interesting.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.200
Despite that, this isn't
enough to change my visions.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.840
I know that.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.410
This isn't enough to
reach your domain.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.610
What's that?

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.850
What's he trying to do?!

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:25.840
Kai!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:31.680
If I want to reach you...

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.120
I have to risk everything!

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:41.900
All of it. My rage...

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.660
My hatred!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.820
The fun of battle!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:18.580
My joy.
My passion for Beyblading!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:27.040
Take this!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.330
You can do this!
You can do it, Kai!

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.400
Not bad!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.440
I've never seen Brooklyn
on the defensive!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:52.480
Even Brooklyn can
make mistakes.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:56.180
Do you think
this is all he has?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.360
What?

00:15:57.610 --> 00:16:02.450
I guess you didn't see it, then?
Brooklyn's real power...

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:05.880
Is beyond even
that of god's domain.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.160
Good for you!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:18.860
Garland's the only one who's
been able to keep up with me.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:25.580
You made Brooklyn get serious.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.200
Your only hope of winning just
went out the window, Kai Hiwatari.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:39.480
This is fun! But it still
hasn't changed my vision.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.240
No way!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.260
He...

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.170
That's impossible!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:17:01.330
He can use the same moves,
but there's no way he can copy his heart!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:05.100
Then what's he trying to do?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.240
You're wasting your time.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:20.380
Your attacks won't--No, there aren't
any attacks that'll work on me.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:36.410
Damn!
What is this guy?!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:40.730
All those attacks haven't
even made a dent!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:44.730
He's absorbing all
his attack power!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:49.610
You mean he's
absorbing Kai's energy?!

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:12.330
Is this his real power?!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:13.400
But now...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:17.180
No way!
It's not over yet!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.500
But...

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:23.290
Believe in Kai. If we don't,
what else do we have left?!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.900
Takao!

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:29.410
I believe!
I believe that he'll win!

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:32.450
Yeah. I believe, too!

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.210
And so do I!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.650
Me too!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.100
I believe too!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.760
Kai!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.250
Go, go, Kai!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.600
You can do it, Kai!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.740
You gotta win!

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:47.920
My team...
Still believes in me?

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:55.260
This was surprisingly fun. But...

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.300
It's time to wrap this up.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:01.810
As much as I'd like to keep
playing, I think you're through.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.580
I figured it out.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:10.290
For a split second, I got a taste of your true power in our last battle.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.080
Your true nature.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.760
It's the all-consuming
darkness of a black hole!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:22.480
That's right.
Everything is null before me.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:24.000
Not yet...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.380
Yet?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:31.860
I haven't used
everything I've got yet!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.900
You have something else?

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:36.730
Then I'd like to see it.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:43.480
Let me show you what happens
when I sacrifice everything!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.640
Brooklyn, I will defeat you.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:52.040
Even if it ends my life!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.570
Burn! Burn, my flame of life!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.240
Life?

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:04.320
Burn the darkness to ashes!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.970
Impossible!

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.930
Listen, Dranzer...

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.780
Hang in there with
me for a little longer.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:31.750
Until we defeat him.
To the ends of my life.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.720
Just a little longer...

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.940
I see.

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:42.010
I'll fight you for as
long as you want.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.610
Kai!

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.640
You intend
to risk your life?!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.980
We can't let you!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.010
You can't!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:54.040
You can't jump in the
middle of a match!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.250
But...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.340
You want us to
sit and watch?!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:59.760
--Do you want us to abandon him?
--Takao!

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.090
Takao!

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.840
Kai, you...

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.280
You'd go so far to...

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.260
Here I come, Brooklyn!

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:23.780
Until my life burns out!

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:26.580
Kai!!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.300
A phoenix always
comes back to life.

00:22:59.300 --> 00:23:02.660
No matter the damage...
Or if it falls...

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:05.730
Even if it falls into
a pit of despair...

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:10.110
Its blazing wings will
fly another day.

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:13.410
This is my rage.

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:16.940
Grief. Joy.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:19.250
This is my...

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:24.330
Spiraling flames resemble
the light of life.
